WEBVTT

00:12:29.673 --> 00:12:31.663
U usporedbi s tim,

00:12:31.663 --> 00:12:35.737
rat, psihološki, na neki način, je lagan,

00:12:35.737 --> 00:12:38.234
u usporedbi s tom vrstom otuđenja.

00:12:38.234 --> 00:12:40.094
To je zašto im nedostaje,

00:12:40.114 --> 00:12:42.102
i to je ono što moramo shvatiti

00:12:42.102 --> 00:12:45.505
i na neki način popraviti u našem društvu.

00:12:45.505 --> 00:12:48.435
Hvala vam puno.

00:12:48.435 --> 00:12:51.390
(Pljesak)